§ `ss 4, 5, 5A -- does the Act apply` -- c074 Chloe's car

#ASSERT `Was I injured in a motor vehicle accident` `helping at the scene of a motor vehicle accident`
#ASSERT NOT `Was I injured in a motor vehicle accident` `none of these`

#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to my motor vehicle injury` `Chloe's licensed car runs off a WA road in 2034, no one else involved`
#ASSERT NOT `Does the Act apply to my motor vehicle injury` `Liam negligently crashes Chloe's licensed car, Chloe a passenger`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to my motor vehicle injury` `an unlicensed, uninsured car runs out of control on a WA road, no one negligent`
#ASSERT NOT `Does the Act apply to my motor vehicle injury` `a farm ute with no CTP strikes Chloe in a paddock`

#ASSERT `How does the Act take my injury` `a courier's scooter hit by a swerving car, no one negligent` `a work injury, liability accepted` EQUALS `as a motor vehicle injury`
#ASSERT `How does the Act take my injury` `a worker on the road struck by a negligent driver` `a work injury, liability accepted` EQUALS `as a workplace injury`

§ `ss 8, 9, 34(2)(a) -- eligibility and applying` -- c074 Chloe

#ASSERT `Am I eligible to participate in the CISS` `Chloe, spinal cord injury, alone on a WA road`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I eligible to participate in the CISS` `Chloe, a passenger, injured by Liam's negligent driving`
#ASSERT `Am I eligible to participate in the CISS` `a warehouse worker, crushed, claim accepted`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I eligible to participate in the CISS` `the warehouse worker, claim not yet accepted`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I eligible to participate in the CISS` `Chloe alone on a WA road, but future care damages already settled`

#ASSERT `May I apply to join the CISS` `Chloe, a passenger, injured by Liam's negligent driving`
#ASSERT NOT `May I apply to join the CISS` `the warehouse worker, claim accepted, living overseas`

#ASSERT `By when must I apply` EQUALS `none in the Act; any limit is in the regulations, which are not deposited (s 34(2)(a))`

§ `ss 10-14 -- participation`

#ASSERT `What must the Commission accept me as` `Chloe, spinal cord injury, alone on a WA road` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `a lifetime participant`
#ASSERT `What must the Commission accept me as` `a warehouse worker, crushed, claim accepted` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `an interim participant`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I still a participant` `an interim participant` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `Is my participation suspended` `as a workplace injury` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my participation suspended` `as a motor vehicle injury` TRUE FALSE FALSE

§ `ss 6, 17, 18, 19 -- what the Commission pays for` -- c074 Chloe's care

#ASSERT NOT `Is it one of my treatment, care and support needs` `domestic assistance` TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it one of my treatment, care and support needs` `something else the Commission has approved` FALSE

#ASSERT `Must the Commission pay this expense` `Chloe's assessed attendant care from a registered provider` EQUALS `the Commission must pay it`
#ASSERT `Must the Commission pay this expense` `attendant care given free by Chloe's mother` EQUALS `the Commission need not pay it`
#ASSERT `Must the Commission pay this expense` `attendant care given free, the Commission electing to pay` EQUALS `the Commission need not pay it, but has elected to`
#ASSERT `Must the Commission pay this expense` `assessed rehabilitation during a holiday in Bali` EQUALS `the Commission need not pay it`
#ASSERT `Must the Commission pay this expense` `assessed care while participation is suspended, the Commission willing` EQUALS `the Commission need not pay it`

#ASSERT NOT `Will the Commission pay my legal costs for my assessment`

§ `ss 24-27 -- review and appeal`

#ASSERT NOT `Can I ask the Commission to review the decision` `a refusal to pay a particular expense`
#ASSERT `Can I ask the Commission to review the decision` `my treatment, care and support assessment`

#ASSERT `What appeal do I have to the District Court` `whether the incident was a motor vehicle accident` EQUALS `an appeal to the District Court as of right`
#ASSERT `What appeal do I have to the District Court` `whether my injury is catastrophic` EQUALS `an appeal to the District Court only with its leave, on a question of law`
#ASSERT `What appeal do I have to the District Court` `my treatment, care and support assessment` EQUALS `no appeal to the District Court under s 27`

§ `ss 30A(5), 31 -- notice and offences`

#ASSERT `Must I notify the Commission` TRUE TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `How many days do I have to notify the Commission` EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for false or misleading information` EQUALS 10000

§ `ss 5(3), 5A(4); CLA s 13A; MVTPI ss 3EA, 3FB -- the scheme and my common-law claim` -- c074 Chloe and Liam

#ASSERT `Where is my care paid from` `Chloe, spinal cord injury, alone on a WA road` EQUALS `the CISS, as a motor vehicle injury, without proving anyone at fault`
#ASSERT `Where is my care paid from` `Chloe, a passenger, injured by Liam's negligent driving` EQUALS `a common-law damages claim against the negligent owner or driver, met by the vehicle's compulsory third party insurance`

#ASSERT NOT `Can I be awarded damages for this care need` `I am an interim or lifetime participant` `in future`
#ASSERT `Can I be awarded damages for this care need` `I am an interim or lifetime participant` `before I became a participant`
#ASSERT NOT `Can I be awarded damages for this care need` `I was an interim participant and was not made a lifetime participant` `while I was a participant`
#ASSERT `Can I be awarded damages for this care need` `I was an interim participant and was not made a lifetime participant` `in future`
#ASSERT `Can I be awarded damages for this care need` `I was a lifetime participant and was notified I am no longer eligible` `while I was a participant`

#ASSERT NOT `Can my damages be reduced for my own fault` TRUE TRUE

